          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rat_Burgiss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rat Burgiss</a>, south-east of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock</a> lodestone by the crossroads to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Rat Burgiss, south-east of the Varrock lodestone by the crossroads to Lumbridge.",
